    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade </strong>your spells from basic functionality to a devastating power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/0e7baf6aab1989a6dfec4f3e7446ea67.poster.avif?t=1753116728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/0e7baf6aab1989a6dfec4f3e7446ea67.webm?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/0e7baf6aab1989a6dfec4f3e7446ea67.mp4?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>over 300 challenges</strong> to gain the advantage of <strong>over 300 interesting unlocks</strong>, with <strong>quite a lot</strong> of new additions to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/547e6279d06614652d56b7108df0dcd7.poster.avif?t=1753116728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/547e6279d06614652d56b7108df0dcd7.webm?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/547e6279d06614652d56b7108df0dcd7.mp4?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over <strong>30 different events</strong> which may trigger throughout a run for even more variety and build customizing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/031908039389eb595ccd9a0fbab837fd.poster.avif?t=1753116728\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/031908039389eb595ccd9a0fbab837fd.webp?t=1753116728\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through <strong>multiple realms</strong>, each one providing a different type of playstyle to all of the character classes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> your own weapon to take with you and overcome the <strong>5 trials</strong> of each realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the archmage of Elewar or will you be brought down by your opponents? Bulletheaven might quickly become a bullethell if you aren't strong enouph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has at least 1 special attack... which you can dodge! There is no simple contact damage, which makes the game <strong>very challenging</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Feature list:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 elements, 20 different offensive spells and 8 utility spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spell may be upgraded in its rarity separately, which enables a diverse and powerful spell progression in a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophecy Whirls, which give you a choice of a random event, may challenge and reward you depending on the chosen difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 character classes with wildly different playstyles, combined with a dual class system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 300 unlocks with corresponding rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 140 upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an unlocked blessing before you start a run, making cool combinations out of classes, blessings and starting spells possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 5 realms with different enemies, rules and trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system to make your own items, which give you an additional edge in the Trials of Elewar. There are 5 different equipment slots with varying crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several hidden secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike gamemode with a highly different gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much much more!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade </strong>your spells from basic functionality to a devastating power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/0e7baf6aab1989a6dfec4f3e7446ea67.poster.avif?t=1753116728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/0e7baf6aab1989a6dfec4f3e7446ea67.webm?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/0e7baf6aab1989a6dfec4f3e7446ea67.mp4?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>over 300 challenges</strong> to gain the advantage of <strong>over 300 interesting unlocks</strong>, with <strong>quite a lot</strong> of new additions to the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/547e6279d06614652d56b7108df0dcd7.poster.avif?t=1753116728\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/547e6279d06614652d56b7108df0dcd7.webm?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/547e6279d06614652d56b7108df0dcd7.mp4?t=1753116728\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from over <strong>30 different events</strong> which may trigger throughout a run for even more variety and build customizing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/031908039389eb595ccd9a0fbab837fd.poster.avif?t=1753116728\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489560/extras/031908039389eb595ccd9a0fbab837fd.webp?t=1753116728\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through <strong>multiple realms</strong>, each one providing a different type of playstyle to all of the character classes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft</strong> your own weapon to take with you and overcome the <strong>5 trials</strong> of each realm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become the archmage of Elewar or will you be brought down by your opponents? Bulletheaven might quickly become a bullethell if you aren't strong enouph!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has at least 1 special attack... which you can dodge! There is no simple contact damage, which makes the game <strong>very challenging</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Feature list:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 elements, 20 different offensive spells and 8 utility spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spell may be upgraded in its rarity separately, which enables a diverse and powerful spell progression in a run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophecy Whirls, which give you a choice of a random event, may challenge and reward you depending on the chosen difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 character classes with wildly different playstyles, combined with a dual class system. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >over 300 unlocks with corresponding rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 140 upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose an unlocked blessing before you start a run, making cool combinations out of classes, blessings and starting spells possible!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 5 realms with different enemies, rules and trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting system to make your own items, which give you an additional edge in the Trials of Elewar. There are 5 different equipment slots with varying crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several hidden secrets to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A roguelike gamemode with a highly different gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much much more!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Use your elemental powers to defeat terrifying monsters, while slowly becoming a godlike magician. Packed with challenging events, deep ARPG-like systems and a hardcore difficulty! 18+ classes, 25+ spells, 300+ unlocks, 140+ upgrades, over 50 random events and much more!",
